# Flight Data API Configuration

# Travelpayouts API (Primary - Real Flight Deals)
# 1. Sign up at: https://www.travelpayouts.com/
# 2. Get your token from: https://www.travelpayouts.com/developers/api
# 3. Documentation: https://support.travelpayouts.com/hc/en-us/articles/203956163-Travel-API
VITE_TRAVELPAYOUTS_TOKEN=7b556221eb1b2d0b1a9a65d3dc8c4344
VITE_TRAVELPAYOUTS_MARKER=371662

# Amadeus API (Optional - Additional flight data)
# Get your Amadeus API credentials at: https://developers.amadeus.com/
VUE_APP_AMADEUS_API_KEY=your_amadeus_api_key_here
VUE_APP_AMADEUS_API_SECRET=your_amadeus_api_secret_here

# Optional: RapidAPI key for additional flight data sources
VUE_APP_RAPIDAPI_KEY=your_rapidapi_key_here
